{"obsah":"<p></p>\n\n</p>\n<p>Sort out your Christmas present – better bike skills for your loved ones or yourself. The new biking season is approaching, and if you want to enjoy it to the full, you need to train what you're not good at and maybe push your personal limits a little. </p>\n<p>Use our gift vouchers, which your partner, child or friend can find under the Christmas tree. Until Christmas we're offering a <strong>15% discount</strong> on all types<strong><a href=\"https://bikeskills.cz/kurz/individualni-kurz/\"> of individual and group courses</a></strong>. A special price can also be agreed depending on the number of participants, hours or repeat courses.</p>\n<p>Don't hesitate to contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@bikeskills.cz\"><strong>info@bikeskills.cz</strong></a>.</p>\n<p>You can buy a voucher <a href=\"https://bikeskills.cz/e-shop/bikeskills-produkty/voucher-bikeskills/\"><strong>HERE</strong></a> and add your requirements in the note. We'll get back to you right away.</p>\n<p>\n\n<p></p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2F20200816_105809.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2F20200816_105809.webp?alt=media 1024w, https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2F20200816_105809.webp?alt=media 600w, https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2F20200816_105809.webp?alt=media 300w, https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%2F20200816_105809.webp?alt=media 768w, https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F08%